10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Grdk4MVHKrsQ7kNvwE2NI3p&_nc_oc=AdrtmYc8idITRkwPQQcQ8RNTA5be3FoU8HwkvdeVotO2xqG2gE3igBjBJnSIaI8BkCw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCj-Ny9GdMYsf3D3iQePFnpIqcaNXJxT4wmRSW6K8VQ6w&oe=6A54F54C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H12Hti50tx0Q7kNvwEnHGXP&_nc_oc=AdpmfqHTcI2ZRCzJyUvN5bMbLmEPk2MQEd1e0Ua9V6Nq7qcTn13C3iinmsHIEiayCk0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBr4BmWJykuZVZZaj2EWzvH9TPLC3rxT13onPzuMVWgoA&oe=6A55063C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HDM5BGaCiBsQ7kNvwEPU-Co&_nc_oc=AdqImxdNY4Q-9J9_wjwhTOUdX_QtgelcvyTG4q2be_uI9-gW2AlSHg3G-B9hUkjB810&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBl8NX8YvxDJGuolyTLINXOY1JvaI7NA-_9ZnBrFUortw&oe=6A54E52B"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore